Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.52,0:00:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.50,0:00:19.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.78,0:00:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you going to ask Santa-san to get you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.05,0:00:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't decided yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.29,0:00:36.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't make up your mind soon, it'll be too late;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.99,0:00:38.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,he has to travel really far to get here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.80,0:00:42.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, really...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.01,0:00:47.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,C'mon now, what is it you want the most?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.25,0:00:50.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A lop-eared.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.35,0:00:52.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You already have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.60,0:00:54.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He needs friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:08.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.25,0:01:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for being late...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.12,0:01:13.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's no problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.46,0:01:15.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.16,0:01:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:22.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.94,0:01:24.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a Christmas tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.28,0:01:25.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:29.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.78,0:01:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah... Something to do with work, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.02,0:01:43.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can I put the tree together?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.04,0:01:43.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.73,0:02:02.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.85,0:02:04.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.05,0:02:10.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This goes on top, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.90,0:02:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure does.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.32,0:02:24.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.88,0:02:25.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.46,0:02:30.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't have a chimney, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.64,0:02:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Santa-san will be able to find his way in, so don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.97,0:02:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, I'll unlock the door for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.31,0:02:42.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm tellin' ya, it'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.04,0:02:57.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's with the carrot?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.43,0:02:59.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's for the reindeer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.52,0:03:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm turning this off, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.50,0:03:16.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just a little longer...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.62,0:03:19.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Santa-san only comes to the houses of sleeping children!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.53,0:03:22.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?! Turn the light off, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.17,0:03:26.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.71,0:04:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I really wanted to meet Santa too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.50,0:05:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.31,0:05:04.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.44,0:05:21.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you too, Mr. Reindeer!
